{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gBarbA-5368": "BARBARIAN: 阿平戈里克斯就在前面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gBarbB-5369": "BARBARIAN: 沿那边继续走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gBarbC-5370": "BARBARIAN: 找老大说去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gBarbD-5371": "BARBARIAN: 别看我，奥斯伦人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-fCampRich-5372": "MAN: 唉，刚逃出来时还觉得像小时候向往的冒险，可那股兴奋劲，一个月前就消磨光了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-fCampLady-5373": "WOMAN: 这几个孩子是我雇主家的，不是我的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-fCampLady-5374": "WOMAN: （悄悄跟你说，我看我们一时半会儿是见不着那位夫人了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-fCampBoy-5375": "BOY: 总有哪个农场有可可吧？不能去问问吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-fHaycartWoman-5376": "WOMAN: 我从小就一无所有，所以这也不算太糟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-fStumpMan-5377": "MAN: 绿色的东西？眼镜裂了，我现在什么都看不清。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-fStolenWoman-5378": "WOMAN: 哦，谢天谢地！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-fStolenWoman-5379": "WOMAN: 那边！它正拖着面粉跑！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-campSoldierA-5380": "SOLDIER: 仗打得怎么样？这里收到的消息，都晚了两个星期。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-fCampBarrel-5381": "MAN: 能从那些废弃农庄里搜罗到这么多物资，已经算走运了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-fCampBarrel-5382": "MAN: 不过，再怎么说也就这些，我们还是得尽量省着用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-forestZikaron-5383": "ZIKARON: ……路……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-forestBekker-5384": "BEKKER: 世界塞满了武器，人们却连彼此信任都做不到……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-forestPavel-5385": "PAVEL: 进去以后，可别让我说奥斯伦语。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-forestMateusz-5386": "MATEUSZ: 但愿真像你说的，能骗过基地里那些人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-campSoldierB-5387": "SOLDIER: 上头不准我们拆掉这些老遗迹，也不知道是为什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-campSoldierB-5388": "SOLDIER: 既然不能拆，我们就只好守在这里，谁敢往上爬，就朝谁开枪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubWelcome-5389": "SOLDIER: 维修队？去找指挥官吧，他在控制室。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubWelcome-5390": "SOLDIER: 冯·罗尔主任刚到，大家都绷着根弦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldier1-5391": "SOLDIER: 伊纳人和雷津人，哪个体内的魔力更多？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcher1-5392": "RESEARCHER: 嗯，大概得看他们靠什么谋生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gsGuard-5393": "SOLDIER: 这里通往幽灵区，没有指挥官许可，谁也不准进去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gsGuard-5394": "SOLDIER: 你们下去的时候，冯·罗尔主任到了，可得小心点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcherC1-5395": "RESEARCHER: 抽取机怎么校准都行，可供能达不到要求，调上一整天也只能靠猜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcherC2-5396": "RESEARCHER: 发电机出事之前，燃料消耗与魔力抽取量的比例，已经调得很不错了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcherC3-5397": "RESEARCHER: 至少等供能恢复了，这台机器就有的是实验对象。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierC-5398": "SOLDIER: 我是不喜欢跟囚犯打交道，可现在整天就只能干站着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierC-5399": "SOLDIER: 从没见过谁能让指挥官紧张成这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierB-5400": "SOLDIER: 但愿冯·罗尔主任来的时候别轮到我当班，他……可不好惹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierB-5401": "SOLDIER: 我最怕他会是什么样，他就偏偏是什么样……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierA-5402": "SOLDIER: 我们一直在试运行，确保镣铐和机器触点都不出问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubCommander-5403": "COMMANDER: 抓紧时间，上士，冯·罗尔主任随时可能到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubLoaderGuy-5404": "SOLDIER: 不知道怎么回事，这地方收到的物资比前线还多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubMobileResearcher-5405": "RESEARCHER: 我还在熟悉新的魔法引擎继电装置。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcherC4-5406": "RESEARCHER: 我们也想把这个过程中释放的热量收集起来利用，不过眼下还是获取魔力更要紧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcherC4a-5407": "RESEARCHER: 自从在大学出了点事，我就只能找到这里的工作了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcherC4a-5408": "RESEARCHER: 薪水不错，研究也有意思，只是……做研究的那些手段，有点不光彩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldier2-5409": "SOLDIER: 幽灵区……我是说发电机那层，上楼梯、往左[oxfordComma /]再下去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldier2-5410": "SOLDIER: 幽区的事，可千万别跟主任提。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcher4-5411": "RESEARCHER: 魔力捕获花了大钱，排气系统却是这么个便宜破……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubLieutenant-5412": "LIEUTENANT: 精神点，士兵！总理交给我们的是重要任务！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSentry1-5413": "SOLDIER: 指挥官？在前面的控制室。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSentry1-5414": "SOLDIER: 指挥官正和主任在上面，别打扰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcherAa-5415": "RESEARCHER: 我们正在查，幽灵区的现象是否由燃料污染导致。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubLoading-5416": "SOLDIER: 这里通往装卸台。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubChow-5417": "SOLDIER: 这里是食堂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearchBreak-5418": "RESEARCHER: 我？休息呢，发电机出了问题，也没多少事可做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-campControl1-5419": "TECH: 人体抽取机停用时，我们还能从一条小地脉汲取魔力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-campControl2-5420": "TECH: 指挥部什么都肯给，可一说要修关键设施，就什么都不给了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gsGuardTip-5421": "SOLDIER: 先往西，再一直向北，就到发电机了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gsGuardTip-5422": "SOLDIER: 要是见到“它们”，就……换条路吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gsGuardTip-5423": "SOLDIER: 等等，你真修好了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-campLogistics1-5424": "OFFICER: 我还以为基地这么机密，文书工作能少些，结果又猜错了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-campLogistics2-5425": "OFFICER: 每天有三个不同的政府部门，找我要详细报告。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-bridgeFarmer-5426": "FARMER: 站住！融雪冲坏了几处支架，别过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-bridgeMan-5427": "MAN: 真的，这桥不安全，有一半的梁都得换掉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-bridgeMan-5428": "MAN: 哦，你想要这个？捡来的，可我看不懂上面的文字。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-bridgeMan-5429": "获得幸运宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-bridgeMan2-5430": "MAN: 现在可以过了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-bridgeMan2-5431": "MAN: 哦，想要这个吗？眼下对我也没什么用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-bridgeMan2-5432": "获得幸运宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-loadingSoldier-5433": "SOLDIER: 装卸是无聊，可也比刷厕所强。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-loadingSoldier2-5434": "SOLDIER: 上士，劳驾，我们这儿得按流程来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-loadingSoldier3-5435": "TECH: 我不是修汽车的……可他们还是把我派到这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcherX9-5436": "TECH: 趁贵宾还没到，修一下这个动力连接装置。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierV1-5437": "SOLDIER: 他们还真是铁了心，要让这个冯·罗尔满意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierV0-5438": "SOLDIER: 主任一来，指挥官就紧张得很。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierV2-5439": "SOLDIER: 光看模样，就够吓人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierV3-5440": "SOLDIER: 这个冯·罗尔，来头不小啊？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierV4-5441": "SOLDIER: 他到底要多加多少守卫？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierV5-5442": "SOLDIER: 就为了这个贵宾，我得值两班岗……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierVb-5443": "SOLDIER: 上面来视察准没好事，尤其是部长来的时候。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-ch6_cordeliaPostBoss-5444": "CORDELIA: 我必须说明，这些机器虽然产自我国，却是非法制造的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-ch6_cordeliaPostBoss-5445": "CORDELIA: 而且我几乎可以肯定，就连制造这些机器的人，也不知道它们最终会被用来做什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-ch6_cordeliaPostBoss-5446": "CORDELIA: 请你务必冷静权衡，再采取行动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-ch6_jeromePostBoss-5447": "JEROME: 顺便问问，那种会飞的船，还有多少？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-ch6_jeromePostBoss-5448": "JEROME: 到了上面，尽量保持镇定，你这差事可不好办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubResearcherX2-5449": "TECH: 抽取机早就准备好了，只差供能。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierV8-5450": "SOLDIER: 下一个就是这个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gsGuard2-5451": "SOLDIER: 主任走之前，他们让我们一直待在下面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-gsGuard3-5452": "SOLDIER: 问题看着是修好了，可指挥官还是很担心检查。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-chowSoldier1-5453": "SOLDIER: 我们一直从附近农场抢新鲜食物，现在全抢光了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-chowSoldier2-5454": "TECH: 那些蠢囚犯都是城里人，连农场都没去过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-chowSoldier2-5455": "TECH: 不然还能让他们干活，好歹让我们吃上点新鲜的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-chowSoldier3-5456": "SOLDIER: 给家里写信，不许提这座设施，也不许提我们的工作。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-campHPtome-5457": "找到生命宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter6/ch6NPCs.yarn-hubSoldierVa-5458": "SOLDIER: 别打扰主任。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3352": "Title: 真不容易",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3353": "Description: 追赶逃向西南方的哥布林。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3354": "Title: 麻烦总是接着来",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3355": "Description: 继续前往西北方的林中空地。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3356": "Title: 敌人的敌人",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3357": "Description: 在空地上方与阿平戈里克斯交谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3358": "Title: 潜入",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3359": "Description: 找到营地指挥官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3360": "Title: 你说有幽灵？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3361": "Description: 从西南方的楼梯进入幽灵区。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3362": "Title: 报告！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3363": "Description: 回去向指挥官报告。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3364": "Title: 好戏开场",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3365": "Description: 检查抽取装置，做好逃跑准备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3366": "Title: 逃离！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3367": "Description: 逃进山里！"
}
